# Fanatic of the Harrowing: "If you discarded a card this way, draw a card" asks whether Bot1 discarded, not where the card ended up
# (CR 701.9a, 614.6). Bot1's Rest in Peace exiles every card that would go to a graveyard, so the Mountain Bot1 discards goes to
# exile instead (and Bot2's Plains too): it was still discarded, so Bot1 draws the Ornithopter on top of its library.

